[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:45. The Boss's Letter]
[00:00.800]Lesson 45. | 第45课。
[00:02.920]Can you come here a minute, please, Bob? | 鲍勃，你能过来一下吗？
[00:06.310]Yes, sir. | 是的，先生。
[00:07.935]Where's Miss Jones? | 琼斯小姐在哪儿？
[00:10.720]She's next door. | 她在隔壁。
[00:12.505]She's in her office, sir. | 她在办公室里，先生。
[00:14.630]Can she type this letter for me? | 她能帮我打这封信吗？
[00:17.960]Ask her, please. | 请她来一下。
[00:20.095]Yes, sir. | 是的，先生。
[00:21.940]Can you type this letter for the boss, please, Miss Jones? | 琼斯小姐，你能帮老板打这封信吗？
[00:26.560]Yes, of course I can. | 是的，当然可以。
[00:29.295]Here you are. | 给你。
[00:30.700]Thank you, Bob. | 谢谢你，鲍勃。
[00:32.640]Bob! | 鲍勃！
[00:34.225]Yes? What's the matter? | 是的？怎么了？
[00:36.560]I can't type this letter. | 我打不了这封信。
[00:39.685]I can't read it. | 我看不懂。
[00:42.220]The boss's handwriting is terrible. | 老板的笔迹太糟糕了。